"italic\">Are there \u2026 ?</span> to make a question.<br/><br/>You use expressions like <span class = \"italic\">left, right, straight ahead, across from</span> or <span class = \"italic\">next to</span> to say where things are."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"2\",\"columns\":\"2\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Question\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Answer\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Is there + singular noun?<br/>Are there + plural noun?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Yes, it is ... / No, there isn't.<br/>Yes, there are ... / No, there aren't.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class = \"strong\">Peter</span>: Is there a library in the neighborhood?<br/><span class = \"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes. It is straight ahead, across from the park."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class = \"strong\">John</span>: Are there many restaurants in your neighborhood?<br/><span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes, there are some next to the swimming pool."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Prepositions of Place"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use the following prepositions of place and expressions to talk about places in a neighborhood or city."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"7\",\"columns\":\"3\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Preposition</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Description</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Example</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"right\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Turning to the direction of your right hand\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">The park is on the right.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"left\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Turning to the direction of your left hand\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">The park is on the left.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"straight ahead\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Going straight in front of you\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">The stadium is straight ahead.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"next to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Beside you\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">The bakery is next to the restaurant.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"near\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Close to you\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">The bakery is near the restaurant.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"across from\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Opposite from you\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">The restaurant is across from the park.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "across from"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "opposite; on the other side of something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(preposition)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There is a park across from the stadium."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le06ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to describe a neighborhood."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bakery"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a place to buy bread, cake"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  Sally always goes to the bakery to buy bread."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le06ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "next to"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "at the side of something or someone"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(preposition)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The bakery is next to the restaurant, I think \u2026"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le06ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "right there"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "at that exact spot"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The bakery is right there, near the park."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le06ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "straight ahead"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "right in your path"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The park is straight ahead. Then, there is the bakery."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le06ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tree"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a large plant with a trunk and roots in the ground"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like to look at the trees in the park."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le06ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn2le06ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Make a list of the places you know in your neighborhood."}, {"type": "